{"id": "spring-core/src/main/java/org/springframework/core/convert/support/CollectionToCollectionConverter.java::29::1", "file": "spring-core/src/main/java/org/springframework/core/convert/support/CollectionToCollectionConverter.java", "module": "spring-core", "block_start": 29, "start": 32, "end": 35, "indent": "", "lines": ["<p>First, creates a new Collection of the requested targetType with a size equal to the", "size of the source Collection. Then copies each element in the source collection to the", "target collection. Will perform an element conversion from the source collection's", "parameterized type to the target collection's parameterized type if necessary."]}
